      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/bath_corner_south_dakota"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Bath Corner sits at an elevation of 1,303 feet within a landscape of open plains and agricultural fields.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
